{% package prompt %}

{% func GenTrainingStructuring(reasoningOutput string) -%}
Extract the training program from the reasoning below into the provided JSON schema.
Use exercise IDs (not names) for exercise_id fields. Map [FN] markers to the fact_indices array.
If the reasoning assigns modifier IDs to an activity (e.g. "weighted vest", "ankle weights"), include them in that activity's `modifiers` array using the exact IDs from the reasoning. Leave `modifiers` empty only when the reasoning does not assign any to that activity.

{%s reasoningOutput %}
{% endfunc %}
